 | Rich text by touch | `rich-editor.md`, #1368, [#1338](https://github.com/nsgo-dev/nsgo/issues/1338) | A `RichEditor` selects by touch with handles and the system edit menu on iOS and Android. Headless tests cover gestures and edit actions; an iOS 27 simulator checks native long-press selection, handle dragging, visible menu actions changing with editability and Copy through the input responder. Android’s wire protocol and Java runtime compile against API 36. Physical iOS and Android acceptance remains open (2026-11-22). |
